OL,3,GNEWSAPair face murder charges after
OL,4,Acyclist's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fmurdering a cyclist who died five years
OL,8,Fafter he was attacked.
OL,10,FStephen McMurdo from Bexhill suffered a
OL,11,Fserious head injury when he was struck
OL,12,Fby a ball bearing on Bexhill Road in St
OL,13,FLeonards, East Sussex, in July 2020,
OL,14,Fand died in October 2025 aged 71, said
OL,15,FSussex Police.
OL,17,FJoshua O'Toole, 29, and Lloyd Powell,
OL,18,F32, faced murder charges at Lewes Crown
OL,19,FCourt on Monday after initially being
OL,20,Faccused of causing grievous bodily harm
OL,21,Fin 2023.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
