OL,3,GNEWSAPair face murder charges after
OL,4,Acyclist's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a tribute released by Sussex Police,
OL,7,FMcMurdo's wife Jaki said: "Steve was a
OL,8,Fwonderful husband, father and brother
OL,9,Fwho loved, supported and understood me.
OL,10,FHe made me laugh a lot."
